This case study uses exactly the same underlying logic as the HelpDesk system (category check + point level check, one-time completion, multiple attempts allowed), but in a completely different domain: university course registration instead of IT support tickets. You can reuse the same Java code with minimal renaming (e.g., Employee → Student, Ticket → Course, HelpDesk → Registrar) to process this case.